    the cloud both keep less. Drawn the way Ente Photos draws its "e": a
    white area with a 2.5 dp #1C1C1C outline outside it and a faint #E8E8E8
    inner crescent; the picture an ink tile with white mountains and a sun;
    the arrow in the green of Ente's heart (#20D34F) inside its 2.2 dp
    outline. Lines and circular arcs only. Background layer: flat #08C225.
-->
